2, checkout-api). It describes the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state.\n\nFollow-up needed: someone should investigate why v2.3.1 failed health checks and why the orchestrator partially failed. Re-releasing v2.3.1 would need a fix first.", "type": "text"}]}]}